#: ../developer/batches.md:1
msgid "Batch Inference"
msgstr "批量推理"

#: ../developer/batches.md:3
msgid ""
"A batch is a set of inference requests you send in one call and collect "
"later. You submit the job, poll it, then read the results. The gateway "
"runs the requests in the background, a few at a time per model, beside "
"its interactive traffic."
msgstr "批次是一次调用发送、稍后收取结果的一组推理请求。你提交任务，轮询状态，然后读取结果。网关在后台运行这些请求，每个模型同时只运行几个，与交互式流量并行。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:5
msgid ""
"There is one batch API, `/v1/batches`. Each batch has one target, the "
"endpoint all its requests are for:"
msgstr "网关只有一个 Batch API：`/v1/batches`。每个批次有一个目标，即其所有请求发往的端点："

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "Target"
msgstr "目标"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "`url` / `endpoint`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "Request body"
msgstr "请求体"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "Chat completions"
msgstr "Chat Completions"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "`/v1/chat/completions`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "A chat completion request"
msgstr "一个 Chat Completions 请求"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "Embeddings"
msgstr "Embeddings"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "`/v1/embeddings`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "An embeddings request"
msgstr "一个 Embeddings 请求"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "Responses"
msgstr "Responses"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "`/v1/responses`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "An independent Responses request"
msgstr "一个独立的 Responses 请求"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "Messages"
msgstr "Messages"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "`/v1/messages`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid ""
"An Anthropic Messages request; the create call also sends the `anthropic-"
"version` header"
msgstr "一个 Anthropic Messages 请求；创建调用还要发送 `anthropic-version` 请求头"

#: ../developer/batches.md:14
msgid "The requests arrive in one of two ways:"
msgstr "请求有两种提交方式："

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "Input method"
msgstr "输入方式"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "Submit"
msgstr "提交"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "Results"
msgstr "结果"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "Direct requests"
msgstr "直接提交请求"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "`POST /v1/batches` with the requests in a `requests` array"
msgstr "`POST /v1/batches`，请求放在 `requests` 数组里"

#: ../developer/batches.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Paged from `/v1/batches/{id}/results`, or one JSONL export"
msgstr "从 `/v1/batches/{id}/results` 分页读取，或一次导出为 JSONL"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "JSONL file"
msgstr "JSONL 文件"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid ""
"Upload a JSONL file to `/v1/files`, then `POST /v1/batches` with its "
"`input_file_id`"
msgstr "先把 JSONL 文件上传到 `/v1/files`，再带上它的 `input_file_id` 调用 `POST /v1/batches`"

#: ../developer/batches.md
msgid "An output file and an error file, downloaded from `/v1/files`"
msgstr "一个输出文件和一个错误文件，从 `/v1/files` 下载"

#: ../developer/batches.md:21
msgid ""
"Every batch is the same object, with the same statuses, results, cancel "
"and delete. The shapes follow OpenAI's Batch API; see [Compared with "
"OpenAI's batch API](#compared-with-openais-batch-api). The official "
"OpenAI SDKs work with the file flow for the chat, embeddings and "
"Responses targets: set the base URL to `https://your-gateway.example/v1` "
"and pass your gateway API key. Direct requests, the results pages and the"
" Messages target are this gateway's own, so call them over HTTP as the "
"examples below do. Anthropic's Message Batches API "
"(`/v1/messages/batches`, the Anthropic SDKs' `messages.batches`) is not "
"served; see [Moving from Message Batches](#moving-from-message-batches)."
msgstr ""
"所有批次都是同一种对象，状态、结果、取消和删除的方式都相同。其结构遵循 OpenAI 的 Batch API；参见[与 OpenAI Batch "
"API 的比较](#compared-with-openais-batch-api)。官方 OpenAI SDK 可用于 Chat "
"Completions、Embeddings 和 Responses 目标的文件流程：把 base URL 设为 `https://your-"
"gateway.example/v1`，并传入你的网关 API 密钥。直接提交请求、结果分页和 Messages "
"目标是本网关自己的扩展，请像下面的示例那样通过 HTTP 调用。本网关不提供 Anthropic 的 Message Batches "
"API（`/v1/messages/batches`，即 Anthropic SDK 的 `messages.batches`）；参见[从 "
"Message Batches 迁移](#moving-from-message-batches)。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:24
msgid ""
"By default only `internal` users and administrators can create batches; "
"the operator can open them to other roles. A gateway with batch inference"
" turned off, or without a database, answers every batch route with `404`."
msgstr ""
"默认只有 `internal` 用户和管理员可以创建批次；运维人员可以向其他角色开放。关闭了批量推理或没有数据库的网关，对所有批次路由都返回 "
"`404`。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:27
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: ../developer/batches.md:29
msgid ""
"Creating a batch stores its requests and runs nothing. Every request is "
"checked first: direct requests before the create call answers, a file in "
"the background. One invalid request refuses the whole batch, before any "
"inference call. Checks apply the same per-request limits as interactive "
"requests on messages, content parts, tools and stop sequences, and every "
"JSON number must be finite, including numbers inside tool arguments and "
"schemas."
msgstr ""
"创建批次只会保存其请求，不运行任何东西。每个请求都会先经过检查：直接提交的请求在创建调用返回之前检查，文件则在后台检查。只要有一个请求无效，整个批次都会被拒绝，此时不会发出任何推理调用。检查对消息、内容块、工具和停止序列应用与交互式请求相同的单请求限制，所有"
" JSON 数字都必须是有限值，包括工具参数和 schema 中的数字。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:31
msgid ""
"The gateway's worker then starts requests as their models have room, in "
"no particular order. Each runs as if you had sent it to its endpoint "
"yourself: the same models, fallback and price, logged under your account "
"and counted toward your daily cost quota. By default it runs only on "
"routes the gateway hosts itself (see [Which routes batch work may use"
"](#which-routes-batch-work-may-use)). It takes no slot of your "
"concurrent-request limit, because batch work has its own per-role quota, "
"and a model runs fewer batch requests while interactive requests are in "
"flight on it, so a batch slows down when interactive traffic is heavy."
msgstr ""
"随后，网关的 worker "
"在模型有空闲容量时启动请求，顺序不固定。每个请求的运行方式就像你自己把它发到对应端点一样：同样的模型、回退和价格，记在你的账户下，并计入你的每日费用额度。默认情况下，它只在网关自己托管的路由上运行（参见[批处理可以使用哪些路由"
"](#which-routes-batch-work-may-"
"use)）。它不占用你的并发请求名额，因为批量任务有自己按角色划分的额度；而当某个模型上有交互式请求在处理时，该模型会少运行一些批量请求，所以交互式流量大时批次会变慢。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:33
msgid "Each request succeeds or fails on its own:"
msgstr "每个请求独立地成功或失败："

#: ../developer/batches.md:35
msgid ""
"A failure that may pass (`408`, `425`, `429`, a `5xx`) is retried with "
"exponential backoff, from 5 seconds up to 15 minutes, with jitter, while "
"the batch's window is open. When the next try would start after the "
"window closes, the request fails with its last error."
msgstr ""
"可能自行恢复的失败（`408`、`425`、`429`、`5xx`）会在批次窗口开放期间以指数退避方式重试，间隔从 5 秒增加到最长 15 "
"分钟，并带随机抖动。如果下一次重试会在窗口关闭之后才开始，该请求以最后一次的错误失败。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:36
msgid "Any other `4xx` fails at once."
msgstr "其他任何 `4xx` 都会立即失败。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:37
msgid ""
"A timeout (a `504`, or the upstream call's own timeout) fails at once "
"with `timeout`: it is usually a long or repetitive output with a large "
"`max_tokens`, which would time out again. It doesn't count toward pausing"
" the model, which several retryable failures in a row do. A connection "
"that times out while opening reached nobody and is retried."
msgstr ""
"超时（`504`，或上游调用自身的超时）会立即以 `timeout` 失败：这通常是在 `max_tokens` "
"很大时生成了很长或重复的输出，重试也会再次超时。它不计入暂停模型的条件，而连续多次可重试的失败会暂停模型。建立连接时就超时的请求没有到达任何地方，会被重试。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:38
msgid ""
"A provider response that cannot be encoded as valid JSON and UTF-8 fails "
"with `upstream_error` (`502`), without a retry; any known charge stays "
"recorded."
msgstr ""
"无法编码为有效 JSON 和 UTF-8 的 provider 响应会以 "
"`upstream_error`（`502`）失败，不再重试；已知的费用仍会被记录。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:39
msgid ""
"An on-demand model (a cluster job, say) may answer `503` `model_queued` "
"while it waits for a GPU. That is not a failure and spends no attempt: "
"the request waits for the deployment's `Retry-After` (two minutes if "
"absent or invalid, at most 168 hours), the worker sends that model no new"
" batch requests for as long (at most 15 minutes), and this repeats until "
"the model is up or the window ends. Interactive callers get the same "
"`503`; the circuit breaker and failed-request alerts ignore it. A wait "
"longer than `BATCH_QUEUED_ALERT_HOURS` raises one \"Batch model waiting "
"for capacity\" alert."
msgstr ""
"按需启动的模型（例如集群作业）在等待 GPU 时可能返回 `503` "
"`model_queued`。这不算失败，也不消耗尝试次数：请求会等待部署给出的 `Retry-After`（缺失或无效时为两分钟，最长 168 "
"小时），在此期间 worker 不再向该模型发送新的批量请求（最长 15 分钟），如此反复，直到模型就绪或窗口结束。交互式调用方会收到同样的 "
"`503`；熔断器和失败请求告警会忽略它。等待超过 `BATCH_QUEUED_ALERT_HOURS` 会触发一条“Batch model "
"waiting for capacity”告警。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:41
msgid ""
"With `BATCH_COMPLETION_WINDOW_HOURS` set to `0`, a new batch has a `null`"
" `expires_at` and never expires; a request that keeps failing for a "
"reason that may pass is tried at most 2,000 times (about two weeks at the"
" backoff cap)."
msgstr ""
"当 `BATCH_COMPLETION_WINDOW_HOURS` 设为 `0` 时，新批次的 `expires_at` 为 "
"`null`，永不过期；因可能自行恢复的原因反复失败的请求最多尝试 2,000 次（按退避上限约两周）。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:43
msgid ""
"Before each request, the gateway checks the API key that created the "
"batch again:"
msgstr "每个请求运行前，网关都会重新检查创建该批次的 API 密钥："

#: ../developer/batches.md:45
msgid ""
"a revoked or expired key, or a suspended or deleted account, fails the "
"batch;"
msgstr "密钥被吊销或已过期，或账户被停用或删除，批次失败；"

#: ../developer/batches.md:46
msgid "a spent daily quota pauses your batches until it renews at midnight UTC;"
msgstr "每日额度用完时，你的批次暂停，直到额度在 UTC 午夜重置；"

#: ../developer/batches.md:47
msgid ""
"a spent monthly quota pauses them, with a check within the hour, until it"
" is raised or renews on the 1st (UTC);"
msgstr "每月额度用完时，批次暂停，并在一小时内重新检查，直到额度被调高或在每月 1 日（UTC）重置；"

#: ../developer/batches.md:48
msgid ""
"a key that has spent its own daily or monthly budget pauses the batches "
"created with it, with a check within the hour; your other keys' batches "
"keep running;"
msgstr "密钥用完其自身的每日或每月预算时，用该密钥创建的批次暂停，并在一小时内重新检查；你其他密钥的批次继续运行；"

#: ../developer/batches.md:49
msgid "a role that no longer allows batches pauses them until it does."
msgstr "角色不再允许使用批次时，批次暂停，直到再次允许。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:51
msgid ""
"Running requests count against quotas at what they may cost. If only "
"those stand in the way and actual charges leave room, the request waits "
"half a minute instead of pausing. Keep the key you created a batch with "
"until the batch finishes."
msgstr "正在运行的请求按其可能产生的费用计入额度。如果只是它们造成了阻碍，而实际已扣的费用还有余量，请求会等待半分钟，而不是暂停。在批次完成之前，请保留创建它的密钥。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:53
msgid "Create a batch"
msgstr "创建批次"

#: ../developer/batches.md:55
msgid "`POST /v1/batches` with your API key:"
msgstr "用你的 API key 调用 `POST /v1/batches`："

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Required"
msgstr "必填"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`requests`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "yes"
msgstr "是"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "The requests, at least one"
msgstr "请求列表，至少一个"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`requests[].custom_id`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"Your name for the request, 1–512 characters, unique in the batch. Results"
" carry it back"
msgstr "你给请求起的名字，1–512 个字符，在批次内唯一。结果中会原样带回"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`requests[].method`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "no"
msgstr "否"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`POST`, the default"
msgstr "`POST`，默认值"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`requests[].url`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"The target: `/v1/chat/completions` (the default), `/v1/embeddings`, "
"`/v1/responses` or `/v1/messages`. Every request of one batch uses the "
"same `url`"
msgstr ""
"目标：`/v1/chat/completions`（默认）、`/v1/embeddings`、`/v1/responses` 或 "
"`/v1/messages`。同一批次的所有请求使用同一个 `url`"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`requests[].body`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"The request body, as you would send it to that endpoint. `stream` must "
"not be `true`"
msgstr "请求体，与你直接发给该端点时一样。`stream` 不能为 `true`"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`metadata`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"Up to 16 string pairs for your own use; keys up to 64 characters, values "
"up to 512"
msgstr "最多 16 对字符串，供你自己使用；键最长 64 个字符，值最长 512 个字符"

#: ../developer/batches.md:95
msgid ""
"A batch of direct requests may use several models, but not auto models "
"(`auto`, `auto-<tier>`). An alias is resolved when you create the batch: "
"the stored request keeps the name you sent, but runs on the alias's model"
" at that time, so changing the alias later moves nothing."
msgstr "直接提交的批次可以使用多个模型，但不能使用自动模型（`auto`、`auto-<tier>`）。别名在创建批次时解析：保存的请求保留你发送的名称，但在当时该别名对应的模型上运行，因此之后修改别名不会移动任何请求。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:97
msgid ""
"An invalid request refuses the whole batch with the usual error shape, "
"naming the request. A model you may not use is reported like one that "
"does not exist:"
msgstr "无效的请求会以常见的错误格式拒绝整个批次，并指明是哪个请求。你无权使用的模型与不存在的模型报告方式相同："

#: ../developer/batches.md:108
msgid "The answer is the new batch:"
msgstr "返回的是新建的批次："

#: ../developer/batches.md:137
msgid ""
"A batch of direct requests has `null` file fields. `usage` totals the "
"tokens of finished requests. These fields are this gateway's own: "
"`anthropic_version` (a Messages batch's version), `cost_usd` (what "
"finished requests were billed so far), `cost_unknown_attempts` (see "
"[Costs](#costs)), `results_expires_at` (when results will be deleted) and"
" `error` (why the whole batch failed)."
msgstr ""
"直接提交的批次的文件字段为 `null`。`usage` 汇总已完成请求的 "
"token。以下字段是本网关自己的：`anthropic_version`（Messages "
"批次的版本）、`cost_usd`（已完成请求至今的计费）、`cost_unknown_attempts`（见[费用](#costs)）、`results_expires_at`（结果的删除时间）和"
" `error`（整个批次失败的原因）。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:139
msgid "Check on a batch"
msgstr "查看批次"

#: ../developer/batches.md:141
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Poll `GET /v1/batches/{id}` until `status` is `completed`, `failed`, "
"`expired` or `cancelled`:"
msgstr ""
"轮询 `GET /v1/batches/{id}`，直到 `status` 变为 `completed`、`failed`、`expired` 或"
" `cancelled`："

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`validating`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Stored; no request has started yet"
msgstr "已存储；还没有请求开始运行"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`in_progress`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Requests are running"
msgstr "请求正在运行"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`finalizing`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"A file batch: every request has finished and its output files are being "
"written"
msgstr "文件批次：所有请求都已结束，正在写入输出文件"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`completed`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"Every request has finished, successfully or not. Read each one's outcome "
"in the results"
msgstr "所有请求都已结束，无论成功与否。每个请求的结果请在结果中查看"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`failed`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"The creating key or account is no longer valid (`error` is "
"`owner_unauthorized`), and unstarted requests fail with `batch_failed`. A"
" file batch also fails when its input is invalid; nothing runs and "
"`errors` lists the problems"
msgstr ""
"创建批次的密钥或账户已失效（`error` 为 `owner_unauthorized`），尚未开始的请求以 `batch_failed` "
"失败。文件批次在输入无效时也会失败；此时不运行任何请求，`errors` 列出问题"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`expired`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"The completion window (`created_at` to `expires_at`) closed first. "
"Unstarted requests are `expired` with `batch_expired`; finished ones keep"
" their results"
msgstr ""
"完成窗口（从 `created_at` 到 `expires_at`）先关闭了。尚未开始的请求为 `expired`，错误为 "
"`batch_expired`；已完成的请求保留其结果"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`cancelling`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Cancelled while requests were running; they are finishing"
msgstr "在请求运行期间被取消；这些请求正在收尾"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`cancelled`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Cancelled. Requests that had not started never will"
msgstr "已取消。尚未开始的请求不会再运行"

#: ../developer/batches.md:154
msgid ""
"`request_counts.completed` counts requests that succeeded, and "
"`request_counts.failed` those that failed, including those a failed or "
"expired batch never ran. Cancelled requests are in neither."
msgstr ""
"`request_counts.completed` 统计成功的请求，`request_counts.failed` "
"统计失败的请求，包括失败或过期的批次从未运行的请求。已取消的请求两者都不计入。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:156
msgid "Read the results"
msgstr "读取结果"

#: ../developer/batches.md:158
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`GET /v1/batches/{id}/results` pages through the requests in submission "
"order, with each one's outcome:"
msgstr "`GET /v1/batches/{id}/results` 按提交顺序分页列出请求及各自的结果："

#: ../developer/batches.md:206
msgid ""
"`limit` is 1–1000 (default 100), and a page also stops at about 8 MiB, so"
" large results such as embeddings come a few to a page. When `has_more` "
"is `true`, pass the page's `last_id` as `after`. Every request is listed,"
" finished or not; a `queued` or `running` request has no `response` yet "
"but may show its last `error` while it is retried."
msgstr ""
"`limit` 为 1–1000（默认 100），每页还会在约 8 MiB 处截止，因此 embedding "
"这类较大的结果每页只有几条。`has_more` 为 `true` 时，把该页的 `last_id` 作为 `after` "
"传入。所有请求都会列出，无论是否完成；处于 `queued` 或 `running` 的请求还没有 "
"`response`，但在重试期间可能显示其最后一次的 `error`。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:208
msgid ""
"A finished request is `completed`, with its endpoint's response in "
"`response.body` (a chat completion, an embeddings list, a Responses "
"object or a Messages `message`), or `failed`, with an `error`. A request "
"that never ran is `cancelled`, `expired` or `failed`. `error.status` is "
"the HTTP status behind the error, when there was one."
msgstr ""
"已完成的请求为 `completed`，其端点的响应在 `response.body` 中（Chat Completions "
"结果、embedding 列表、Responses 对象或 Messages 的 `message`），或者为 `failed`，带有 "
"`error`。从未运行的请求为 `cancelled`、`expired` 或 `failed`。`error.status` 是错误背后的 "
"HTTP 状态（如果有）。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`code`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`invalid_request`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "The model rejected the request (`400`, `422`)"
msgstr "模型拒绝了请求（`400`、`422`）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`model_not_found`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "The model is gone, or you may no longer use it (`404`)"
msgstr "模型已不存在，或你已无权使用它（`404`）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`forbidden`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Refused (`403`)"
msgstr "被拒绝（`403`）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`rate_limited`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Still rate-limited after every retry (`429`)"
msgstr "所有重试之后仍被限流（`429`）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`timeout`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Ran out of time (`504`); not retried"
msgstr "超时（`504`）；不重试"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`service_unavailable`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "No endpoint could serve it after every retry (`503`)"
msgstr "所有重试之后仍没有端点能处理它（`503`）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`upstream_error`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Another server error after every retry"
msgstr "所有重试之后仍是其他服务器错误"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`result_too_large`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"The response was larger than one request may store, or the batch's "
"responses had reached their storage limit (the requests still to run then"
" fail without running)"
msgstr "响应超过了单个请求可以存储的大小，或者批次的响应已达到存储上限（此后尚未运行的请求不再运行，直接失败）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`batch_failed`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Not run: the batch failed"
msgstr "未运行：批次失败了"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`batch_expired`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Not run before the completion window closed"
msgstr "完成窗口关闭前未能运行"

#: ../developer/batches.md:223
msgid ""
"A short Python client that submits a batch, waits for it and collects "
"every result:"
msgstr "一个简短的 Python 客户端，提交批次、等待完成并收取全部结果："

#: ../developer/batches.md:268
msgid "Retry the failed requests"
msgstr "重试失败的请求"

#: ../developer/batches.md:270
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`POST /v1/batches/{id}/retry-failed` copies a finished batch's requests "
"that failed with `timeout`, `service_unavailable`, `upstream_error` or "
"`rate_limited` into a new batch of direct requests, with their original "
"`custom_id` and body, in submission order. Requests that failed with any "
"other code would fail the same way and are skipped. Completed requests "
"are not rerun or billed again, and the source batch is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"`POST /v1/batches/{id}/retry-failed` 把已结束批次中以 "
"`timeout`、`service_unavailable`、`upstream_error` 或 `rate_limited` "
"失败的请求，按提交顺序连同原来的 `custom_id` "
"和请求体复制到一个新的直接提交批次中。以其他错误码失败的请求会以同样方式再次失败，因此被跳过。已完成的请求不会重新运行或再次计费，源批次保持不变。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:282
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The new batch keeps the source's target and endpoint, and its `metadata` "
"is the source's plus `retried_from`. Results of a retried file batch are "
"paged from `/v1/batches/{id}/results`; there is no output file. Only the "
"owner may retry (an administrator can read, cancel and delete another "
"user's batch, but not retry it), with the role that creating needs. The "
"new batch counts toward the limits on unfinished batches and requests, "
"and each request is billed when it runs. The endpoint answers `409` while"
" the source is not finished or when nothing in it may be retried, and "
"`404` for an unknown, deleted or another user's batch; otherwise it fails"
" like a create call. You can retry the same source again while its "
"results exist."
msgstr ""
"新批次沿用源批次的目标和端点，其 `metadata` 为源批次的 metadata 加上 `retried_from`。重试文件批次得到的结果从"
" `/v1/batches/{id}/results` "
"分页读取，没有输出文件。只有所有者可以重试（管理员可以读取、取消和删除其他用户的批次，但不能重试），且需要创建批次所需的角色。新批次计入未完成批次和请求的限额，每个请求在运行时计费。源批次尚未结束或其中没有可重试的请求时，端点返回"
" `409`；批次不存在、已删除或属于其他用户时返回 `404`；其余情况的失败方式与创建调用相同。只要源批次的结果还在，就可以再次重试它。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:284
msgid "Cancel or delete a batch"
msgstr "取消或删除批次"

#: ../developer/batches.md:286
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`POST /v1/batches/{id}/cancel` cancels the requests that have not "
"started; running ones finish and keep their results. The batch is "
"`cancelling` until they do, then `cancelled`. Cancelling a finished batch"
" returns it unchanged."
msgstr ""
"`POST /v1/batches/{id}/cancel` 取消尚未开始的请求；正在运行的请求会完成并保留结果。在它们完成之前批次处于 "
"`cancelling`，之后变为 `cancelled`。取消已结束的批次会原样返回该批次。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:288
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`DELETE /v1/batches/{id}` deletes a batch with its requests and results, "
"in any status, and answers `{\"id\": \"batch_...\", \"object\": "
"\"batch.deleted\", \"deleted\": true}`. It answers `409` while a request "
"holds a live upstream lease: cancel, wait for running requests to finish "
"or their leases to expire, then delete."
msgstr ""
"`DELETE /v1/batches/{id}` 可在任何状态下删除批次及其请求和结果，返回 `{\"id\": \"batch_...\", "
"\"object\": \"batch.deleted\", \"deleted\": true}`。当有请求持有有效的上游租约时，它返回 "
"`409`：请先取消，等待正在运行的请求完成或其租约过期，然后再删除。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:290
msgid ""
"A finished batch is deleted automatically after the retention period, "
"seven days by default, so collect its results before then."
msgstr "已结束的批次会在保留期（默认七天）之后被自动删除，请在此之前收取结果。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:292
msgid "List your batches"
msgstr "列出你的批次"

#: ../developer/batches.md:294
msgid ""
"`GET /v1/batches` lists your own batches, newest first, with batch "
"objects in `data`. `limit` is 1–100 (default 20); pass the previous "
"page's `last_id` as `after`. The list includes batches created through "
"the removed `/v1/messages/batches` (ids starting `msgbatch_`)."
msgstr ""
"`GET /v1/batches` 按从新到旧列出你自己的批次，批次对象在 `data` 中。`limit` 为 1–100（默认 "
"20）；把上一页的 `last_id` 作为 `after` 传入。列表包括通过已移除的 `/v1/messages/batches` "
"创建的批次（id 以 `msgbatch_` 开头）。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:296
msgid ""
"You can read, download, cancel, delete and list your batches with any of "
"your API keys, even when your role no longer allows creating them or your"
" daily quota is spent. Another user's batch reads as not found; "
"administrators may read, cancel and delete any batch."
msgstr ""
"你可以用任何一个 API "
"密钥读取、下载、取消、删除和列出你的批次，即使你的角色已不允许创建批次或每日额度已用完。其他用户的批次读取结果为未找到；管理员可以读取、取消和删除任何批次。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:298
msgid "Batches from a file"
msgstr "来自文件的批次"

#: ../developer/batches.md:300
msgid ""
"Upload a JSONL file with one request per line, then create a batch from "
"it:"
msgstr "上传每行一个请求的 JSONL 文件，然后用它创建批次："

#: ../developer/batches.md:312
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Each line is `{\"custom_id\", \"method\": \"POST\", \"url\", \"body\"}`, "
"with `url` equal to the batch's `endpoint`, and every line uses the same "
"model. The batch is `validating` while the gateway reads the file in the "
"background. If any line is invalid (not JSON, a repeated `custom_id`, "
"another `url` or model, a body the endpoint would refuse), the batch is "
"`failed`, nothing runs, and `errors` lists the problems by line number. "
"Otherwise it runs, then is briefly `finalizing` while its result files "
"are written, and ends with `output_file_id` (successful requests) and "
"`error_file_id` (the others); either is `null` when it would be empty."
msgstr ""
"每行是 `{\"custom_id\", \"method\": \"POST\", \"url\", \"body\"}`，`url` 与批次的"
" `endpoint` 相同，并且所有行使用同一个模型。网关在后台读取文件期间，批次为 `validating`。只要有一行无效（不是 "
"JSON、`custom_id` 重复、`url` 或模型不同、请求体会被端点拒绝），批次就为 `failed`，不运行任何请求，`errors`"
" 按行号列出问题。否则批次开始运行，写入结果文件时短暂处于 `finalizing`，最后带着 `output_file_id`（成功的请求）和 "
"`error_file_id`（其余请求）结束；任一文件为空时对应字段为 `null`。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:314
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Download the files with `GET /v1/files/{id}/content`. A result file is "
"the same bytes on every download, and its size and SHA-256 (the `ETag`) "
"are fixed when the batch ends. A download is a stream, so it may run as "
"long as `STREAM_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS` allows (an hour by default), not"
" just the 120 seconds an ordinary request gets. `GET /v1/files` lists "
"your files, `GET /v1/files/{id}` returns one and `DELETE /v1/files/{id}` "
"deletes one for good; a deleted output file is not written again, though "
"the batch still names it, and deleting an input file does not affect "
"batches created from it."
msgstr ""
"用 `GET /v1/files/{id}/content` 下载文件。结果文件每次下载的字节都相同，其大小和 SHA-256（即 "
"`ETag`）在批次结束时就已确定。下载是流式的，因此可以持续 `STREAM_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS` "
"允许的时长（默认一小时），而不只是普通请求的 120 秒。`GET /v1/files` 列出你的文件，`GET /v1/files/{id}` "
"返回单个文件，`DELETE /v1/files/{id}` "
"永久删除文件；已删除的输出文件不会再次写入，尽管批次仍然引用它，而删除输入文件不影响用它创建的批次。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:316
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A download rendered from a batch's results or stored requests (a result "
"file, `GET /v1/batches/{id}/output.jsonl`, the console's downloads) holds"
" one of a gateway process's download slots while it runs: each process "
"serves at most 8 at once, 2 per user. Another is refused with `429` and a"
" `Retry-After`; try again once one of yours has finished. A download "
"whose client reads nothing of it for 60 seconds is ended, which frees its"
" slot. An uploaded input file takes no slot."
msgstr ""
"从批次的结果或已存储请求渲染的下载（结果文件、`GET /v1/batches/{id}/output.jsonl`、控制台的下载）"
"在进行期间占用网关进程的一个下载名额：每个进程同时最多处理 8 个，每个用户 2 个。超出的下载会收到 `429` 和 "
"`Retry-After`；请等你的某个下载完成后再试。客户端 60 秒内未读取任何数据的下载会被终止，并释放其名额。上传的输入文件不占用名额。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:316
msgid "With the OpenAI Python SDK:"
msgstr "使用 OpenAI Python SDK："

#: ../developer/batches.md:330
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The results of a finished batch of direct requests are also available as "
"one JSONL file in the same line shape: `GET "
"/v1/batches/{id}/output.jsonl` (`409` until the batch has finished)."
msgstr ""
"已结束的直接提交批次的结果也可以作为一个同样行格式的 JSONL 文件获取：`GET "
"/v1/batches/{id}/output.jsonl`（批次结束之前返回 `409`）。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:332
msgid "Messages in a batch"
msgstr "批次中的 Messages"

#: ../developer/batches.md:334
msgid ""
"A batch with the `/v1/messages` target carries Anthropic Messages bodies,"
" and its create call names their API version in the `anthropic-version` "
"header:"
msgstr ""
"目标为 `/v1/messages` 的批次携带 Anthropic Messages 请求体，其创建调用在 `anthropic-"
"version` 请求头中指明这些请求体所用的 API 版本："

#: ../developer/batches.md:355
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"From a file, every line has `\"url\": \"/v1/messages\"` and the create "
"call (`{\"input_file_id\": \"file-…\", \"endpoint\": \"/v1/messages\", "
"\"completion_window\": \"24h\"}`) sends the same header. With the OpenAI "
"SDK:"
msgstr ""
"使用文件时，每行都有 `\"url\": \"/v1/messages\"`，创建调用（`{\"input_file_id\": "
"\"file-…\", \"endpoint\": \"/v1/messages\", \"completion_window\": "
"\"24h\"}`）发送同样的请求头。使用 OpenAI SDK："

#: ../developer/batches.md:366
msgid ""
"The header is required for a Messages batch and refused on any other. The"
" known versions are `2023-06-01` and `2026-10-21`; "
"`BATCH_ANTHROPIC_VERSIONS` chooses which new batches may use. Only the "
"header names the version: an `anthropic_version` field in the create body"
" or in a request body is refused."
msgstr ""
"Messages 批次必须带这个请求头，其他批次带了则会被拒绝。已知版本为 `2023-06-01` 和 "
"`2026-10-21`；`BATCH_ANTHROPIC_VERSIONS` "
"决定新批次可以使用哪些版本。只有请求头可以指定版本：创建请求体或单个请求体中的 `anthropic_version` 字段都会被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:367
msgid ""
"A batch keeps its version (`anthropic_version` in the batch object), and "
"every request is checked and run under it. Under `2026-10-21`, "
"`temperature`, `top_p` and `top_k` are refused, as are document blocks in"
" assistant messages and citations on user text."
msgstr ""
"批次保留其版本（批次对象中的 `anthropic_version`），每个请求都在该版本下检查和运行。在 `2026-10-21` "
"下，`temperature`、`top_p` 和 `top_k` 会被拒绝，assistant 消息中的文档块和用户文本上的引用也会被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:368
msgid ""
"Reading, listing, cancelling, deleting and downloading need no version "
"header."
msgstr "读取、列出、取消、删除和下载都不需要版本请求头。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:369
msgid "`anthropic-beta` is refused, and a request body cannot carry `betas`."
msgstr "`anthropic-beta` 会被拒绝，请求体也不能携带 `betas`。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:370
msgid ""
"A request the gateway cannot run as written refuses the whole batch: "
"server tools, Files API sources, MCP servers, containers, and any "
"parameter the model's route cannot carry, such as extended thinking, "
"cache control or structured output on a non-Anthropic backend. Nothing is"
" silently dropped."
msgstr ""
"网关无法按原样运行的请求会使整个批次被拒绝：服务端工具、Files API 来源、MCP 服务器、容器，以及模型路由无法携带的任何参数，例如非 "
"Anthropic 后端上的扩展思考、缓存控制或结构化输出。任何参数都不会被悄悄丢弃。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:372
msgid ""
"Each request is one inference turn. A result that asks for a tool call is"
" for your program to carry out and send back in a new request; the "
"gateway never runs your tools."
msgstr "每个请求是一轮推理。要求调用工具的结果需要由你的程序执行，再在新的请求中发回；网关从不运行你的工具。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:374
msgid "Moving from Message Batches"
msgstr "从 Message Batches 迁移"

#: ../developer/batches.md:376
msgid ""
"The gateway does not serve Anthropic's Message Batches routes, "
"`/v1/messages/batches` and `/anthropic/v1/messages/batches`. Every "
"operation under them answers `410 Gone` with a note on where to go, so "
"the Anthropic SDKs' `messages.batches` methods fail. Online "
"`/v1/messages` and `/anthropic/v1/messages` work as usual. Use "
"`/v1/batches` with the Messages target:"
msgstr ""
"网关不提供 Anthropic 的 Message Batches 路由 `/v1/messages/batches` 和 "
"`/anthropic/v1/messages/batches`。其下的每个操作都返回 `410 Gone`，并附有指引说明，因此 "
"Anthropic SDK 的 `messages.batches` 方法会失败。在线的 `/v1/messages` 和 "
"`/anthropic/v1/messages` 照常可用。请改用带 Messages 目标的 `/v1/batches`："

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Message Batches"
msgstr "Message Batches"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`/v1/batches`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`POST /v1/messages/batches`, header `anthropic-version`, body "
"`{\"requests\": [{\"custom_id\", \"params\"}]}`"
msgstr ""
"`POST /v1/messages/batches`，请求头 `anthropic-version`，请求体 `{\"requests\": "
"[{\"custom_id\", \"params\"}]}`"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`POST /v1/batches`, header `anthropic-version`, body `{\"requests\": "
"[{\"custom_id\", \"url\": \"/v1/messages\", \"body\"}]}`"
msgstr ""
"`POST /v1/batches`，请求头 `anthropic-version`，请求体 `{\"requests\": "
"[{\"custom_id\", \"url\": \"/v1/messages\", \"body\"}]}`"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GET /v1/messages/batches`, `GET …/{id}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GET /v1/batches`, `GET /v1/batches/{id}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST …/{id}/cancel`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST /v1/batches/{id}/cancel`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`DELETE …/{id}`, only once ended"
msgstr "`DELETE …/{id}`，仅在结束后"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`DELETE /v1/batches/{id}`, refused only while a request is running"
msgstr "`DELETE /v1/batches/{id}`，只在有请求运行时被拒绝"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GET …/{id}/results` (`{\"custom_id\", \"result\"}` lines)"
msgstr "`GET …/{id}/results`（`{\"custom_id\", \"result\"}` 行）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`GET /v1/batches/{id}/results` (pages) or `/output.jsonl` (the line shape"
" above)"
msgstr "`GET /v1/batches/{id}/results`（分页）或 `/output.jsonl`（上面的行形状）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`processing_status` `in_progress` / `canceling` / `ended`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`status`, as for every batch (`completed`, `cancelled`, `expired`, …)"
msgstr "`status`，与所有批次相同（`completed`、`cancelled`、`expired` 等）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"`request_counts` `processing` / `succeeded` / `errored` / `canceled` / "
"`expired`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`request_counts` `total` / `completed` / `failed`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "An invalid request became one `errored` result and the others ran"
msgstr "无效的请求成为一条 `errored` 结果，其余请求照常运行"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "An invalid request refuses the whole batch before anything runs, naming it"
msgstr "无效的请求会在任何请求运行之前使整个批次被拒绝，并指明是哪一个"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`custom_id` up to 64 letters, digits, `_`, `-`"
msgstr "`custom_id` 最多 64 个字母、数字、`_`、`-`"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`custom_id` of 1–512 characters"
msgstr "`custom_id` 为 1–512 个字符"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Webhook event `message_batch.ended`"
msgstr "Webhook 事件 `message_batch.ended`"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"`batch.completed`, `batch.failed`, `batch.expired` or `batch.cancelled` "
"for a new batch"
msgstr "新批次为 `batch.completed`、`batch.failed`、`batch.expired` 或 `batch.cancelled`"

#: ../developer/batches.md:391
msgid ""
"Batches created through the old routes (ids starting `msgbatch_`) are "
"kept and still run. Manage them through `/v1/batches` and the console "
"like any other batch; their results come as the common result lines. When"
" one ends, its webhook event is still `message_batch.ended`. An "
"`Idempotency-Key` used on the old routes does not replay through "
"`/v1/batches`."
msgstr ""
"通过旧路由创建的批次（id 以 `msgbatch_` 开头）会保留并继续运行。像其他批次一样通过 `/v1/batches` "
"和控制台管理它们；其结果以通用的结果行返回。这类批次结束时，其 webhook 事件仍为 "
"`message_batch.ended`。在旧路由上使用过的 `Idempotency-Key` 不会通过 `/v1/batches` 重放。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:393
msgid ""
"Check your requests before you migrate: a program that sent good and bad "
"requests together now has the whole batch refused, and must drop the "
"request the error names and resubmit."
msgstr "迁移前请检查你的请求：过去把正常请求和无效请求一起发送的程序，现在整个批次都会被拒绝，必须去掉错误信息指明的请求后重新提交。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:395
msgid "Embeddings and Responses in a batch"
msgstr "批次中的 embedding 和 Responses"

#: ../developer/batches.md:397
msgid ""
"`/v1/embeddings` and `/v1/responses` batch like chat completions, inline "
"or from a file. A batched Responses request must be independent: omit "
"`store` or set it to `false`, and leave out `previous_response_id`, "
"`conversation`, `background` and `stream`. Hosted tools, file inputs and "
"any other field the gateway would have to drop are refused."
msgstr ""
"`/v1/embeddings` 和 `/v1/responses` 可以像 Chat Completions "
"一样以内联或文件方式批量提交。批量的 Responses 请求必须是独立的：不传 `store` 或将其设为 `false`，并且不带 "
"`previous_response_id`、`conversation`、`background` 和 "
"`stream`。托管工具、文件输入以及网关必须丢弃的任何其他字段都会被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:399
msgid "Submitting safely twice"
msgstr "安全地重复提交"

#: ../developer/batches.md:401
msgid ""
"Send an `Idempotency-Key` header with a create call to make it safe to "
"retry:"
msgstr "在创建调用中发送 `Idempotency-Key` 请求头，可以安全地重试："

#: ../developer/batches.md:403
msgid ""
"The same key with the same request (and, for a Messages batch, the same "
"`anthropic-version`) returns the batch the first call created, even if "
"your quota has since run out or your role changed. The same key with a "
"different request answers `409`."
msgstr ""
"同一个键配同一个请求（对 Messages 批次还需相同的 `anthropic-"
"version`）会返回第一次调用创建的批次，即使你的额度此后已经用完或角色已经变化。同一个键配不同的请求返回 `409`。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:404
msgid "A key names one batch across both input methods, even when two calls race."
msgstr "一个键在两种输入方式之间只对应一个批次，即使两次调用同时发生也是如此。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:405
msgid ""
"A key is remembered until a day after its batch ends; after the batch is "
"deleted, it answers `410` for at least a day."
msgstr "键会保留到其批次结束后一天；批次被删除后，该键至少在一天内返回 `410`。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:406
msgid ""
"The key belongs to your account, so any of your API keys can replay it, "
"and a replay never changes which key the batch runs under."
msgstr "键属于你的账户，因此你的任何 API 密钥都可以重放它，而重放从不改变批次运行时使用的密钥。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:408
msgid "The SDKs do not send this header for you."
msgstr "SDK 不会替你发送这个请求头。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:410
msgid "Costs"
msgstr "费用"

#: ../developer/batches.md:412
msgid ""
"Each attempt is billed at the same point and price as an interactive "
"request, and the batch adds no charge of its own. `cost_usd` adds up the "
"attempts whose cost is known. When an attempt's result is lost after the "
"request was sent (the gateway timed out, or a worker stopped mid-"
"request), the provider may still have run and charged it. Its cost is "
"then unknown: it counts in `cost_unknown_attempts`, not as zero in "
"`cost_usd`, and a retried request may have run more than once."
msgstr ""
"每次尝试都在与交互式请求相同的计费点、按相同价格计费，批次本身不额外收费。`cost_usd` "
"汇总费用已知的尝试。如果请求发出后尝试的结果丢失（网关超时，或 worker 在请求中途停止），provider "
"可能仍然运行并计费了。此时其费用未知：它计入 `cost_unknown_attempts`，而不是按零计入 "
"`cost_usd`，重试过的请求也可能运行了不止一次。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:414
msgid "Webhooks"
msgstr "Webhook"

#: ../developer/batches.md:416
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Instead of polling, register one HTTPS endpoint for your batches with "
"`PUT /v1/batch_webhook` (`{\"url\": \"https://…\"}`) or on the console's "
"**Batches** page. The answer shows the signing secret, `whsec_…`, once; "
"send `\"rotate_secret\": true` for a new one. `GET /v1/batch_webhook` "
"shows the webhook, `DELETE /v1/batch_webhook` removes it, and `GET "
"/v1/batch_webhook/events` lists recent deliveries."
msgstr ""
"不想轮询的话，可以用 `PUT /v1/batch_webhook`（`{\"url\": \"https://…\"}`）或在控制台的 "
"**Batches** 页面为你的批次注册一个 HTTPS 端点。响应只显示一次签名密钥 `whsec_…`；发送 "
"`\"rotate_secret\": true` 可获取新密钥。`GET /v1/batch_webhook` 显示 "
"webhook，`DELETE /v1/batch_webhook` 删除它，`GET /v1/batch_webhook/events` "
"列出最近的投递。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:418
msgid ""
"`PUT` needs the role that creating a batch needs (`BATCH_MIN_ROLE`) at "
"the time of the request; below it, `PUT` answers `403` and stores or "
"looks up nothing. With a lowered role you can still read your webhook, "
"list its deliveries and delete it, and events for your existing batches "
"are still delivered while it stays enabled."
msgstr ""
"`PUT` 需要请求时具有创建批次所需的角色（`BATCH_MIN_ROLE`）；角色不够时，`PUT` 返回 "
"`403`，不会保存或查询任何内容。角色被降级后，你仍可读取自己的 "
"webhook、列出其投递记录并删除它，只要它保持启用，你现有批次的事件仍会投递。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:420
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"When a batch ends and its results can be read, the gateway POSTs "
"`batch.completed`, `batch.failed`, `batch.expired` or `batch.cancelled` "
"(`message_batch.ended` for a batch created through the old Message "
"Batches routes). The body names only the batch (`{\"id\", \"object\": "
"\"event\", \"type\", \"created_at\", \"data\": {\"id\"}}`); fetch the "
"results with your API key. Deliveries are signed as Standard Webhooks "
"are: verify `webhook-signature` (`v1,` and a base64 HMAC-SHA256 of "
"`\"{webhook-id}.{webhook-timestamp}.{body}\"`, keyed with the base64 part"
" of the secret)."
msgstr ""
"批次结束且结果可读后，网关会 POST `batch.completed`、`batch.failed`、`batch.expired` 或 "
"`batch.cancelled`（通过旧 Message Batches 路由创建的批次为 "
"`message_batch.ended`）。请求体只指明批次（`{\"id\", \"object\": \"event\", "
"\"type\", \"created_at\", \"data\": {\"id\"}}`）；请用你的 API 密钥获取结果。投递按 "
"Standard Webhooks 的方式签名：校验 `webhook-signature`（`v1,` 加上对 `\"{webhook-id"
"}.{webhook-timestamp}.{body}\"` 的 base64 HMAC-SHA256，密钥为签名密钥的 base64 部分）。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:422
msgid ""
"A delivery not answered with a `2xx` is retried with backoff, up to eight"
" attempts; the same event can arrive more than once, so deduplicate on "
"`webhook-id`. Your events go out one at a time. An endpoint that times "
"out on three deliveries in a row gets none for ten minutes, doubling each"
" further time up to an hour. A webhook URL must be HTTPS and reach a "
"public address: private, loopback, link-local and cloud-metadata "
"addresses are refused when the URL is saved, on every redirect and on "
"every connection."
msgstr ""
"未得到 `2xx` 应答的投递会按退避方式重试，最多八次；同一事件可能到达多次，请按 `webhook-id` "
"去重。你的事件逐个发送。连续三次投递超时的端点在十分钟内不再收到投递，之后每次再出现时加倍，最长一小时。webhook URL 必须是 HTTPS"
" 并指向公网地址：私有、回环、链路本地和云元数据地址在保存 URL 时、每次重定向时以及每次连接时都会被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:424
msgid "Batches in the console"
msgstr "控制台中的批次"

#: ../developer/batches.md:426
msgid ""
"The console's **Batches** page (in the side navigation) lists your "
"batches with their name, target, model, input method, status, requests by"
" outcome, tokens and known cost. You can search by name or ID, filter by "
"status, open a batch, cancel or delete it, download its results, and set "
"up your webhook. The page groups statuses for its badges and filter:"
msgstr ""
"控制台的 **Batches** 页面（位于侧边导航）列出你的批次，显示名称、目标、模型、输入方式、状态、按结果统计的请求数、token "
"和已知费用。你可以按名称或 ID 搜索、按状态筛选、打开批次、取消或删除它、下载结果，以及设置 webhook。页面在徽标和筛选器中把状态分组："

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Shown as"
msgstr "显示为"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Statuses"
msgstr "状态"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "**Processing**"
msgstr "**处理中**"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"`validating`, `in_progress`, `finalizing` or `cancelling`; a note says "
"which stage, and that running requests still finish while cancelling"
msgstr ""
"`validating`、`in_progress`、`finalizing` 或 "
"`cancelling`；会有提示说明处于哪个阶段，以及取消期间正在运行的请求仍会完成"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "**Completed**"
msgstr "**已完成**"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`completed`, and every request succeeded"
msgstr "`completed`，且所有请求都成功"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "**With issues**"
msgstr "**有异常**"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"`failed`, `expired` (the execution window ran out before every request "
"started), or `completed` with a request that did not succeed"
msgstr "`failed`、`expired`（执行窗口结束时仍有请求未开始），或 `completed` 但有请求未成功"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "**Cancelled**"
msgstr "**已取消**"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`cancelled`, whatever its requests did before the cancel"
msgstr "`cancelled`，无论取消前请求的结果如何"

#: ../developer/batches.md:435
msgid ""
"A paused batch stays **Processing**, with a note saying why. Results can "
"be downloaded only once the batch has finished."
msgstr "暂停的批次仍显示为 **Processing**，并附有原因说明。只有批次结束后才能下载结果。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:437
msgid ""
"The page is linked while `BATCH_ENABLED` is on and your role reaches "
"`BATCH_MIN_ROLE`, or you have batches or a webhook of your own; quotas "
"and keys play no part. Below `BATCH_MIN_ROLE` the page offers no **Create"
" batch** button, but you can still manage what you have. The console "
"reads this from `GET /user/batch-capabilities`."
msgstr ""
"当 `BATCH_ENABLED` 开启且你的角色达到 `BATCH_MIN_ROLE`，或你自己有批次或 webhook "
"时，侧边导航会显示该页面链接；额度和密钥不起作用。角色低于 `BATCH_MIN_ROLE` 时，页面不提供 **Create batch** "
"按钮，但你仍可管理已有的内容。控制台通过 `GET /user/batch-capabilities` 获取这些信息。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:439
msgid "Creating a batch in the console"
msgstr "在控制台创建批次"

#: ../developer/batches.md:441
msgid ""
"**Create batch** turns a JSONL file into a Chat Completions or Embeddings"
" batch in three steps; nothing runs until you confirm:"
msgstr ""
"**Create batch** 通过三个步骤把 JSONL 文件变成 Chat Completions 或 Embeddings "
"批次；在你确认之前不会运行任何内容："

#: ../developer/batches.md:443
msgid ""
"**Upload data.** Lines as in [Batches from a file](#batches-from-a-file);"
" `url` and `method` may be left out. The page tells Chat from Embeddings "
"by each line's `url`, or by the body (`messages` or `input`), and asks "
"only when no line says. Mixed types, a `url` the body contradicts, or "
"another endpoint are errors."
msgstr ""
"**Upload data.** 文件各行的格式见[从文件创建批次](#batches-from-a-file)；`url` 和 `method`"
" 可以省略。页面根据每行的 `url` 或请求体（`messages` 或 `input`）区分 Chat 和 "
"Embeddings，只有在没有任何一行能说明时才询问你。混合两种类型、`url` 与请求体矛盾，或使用其他端点，都是错误。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:444
msgid ""
"**Configure.** Name the batch, and optionally describe it. Keep the "
"file's model or choose one for every request, which you must do when the "
"file names several models or one you cannot use. For Chat you may also "
"set `temperature` and `max_tokens` for every request."
msgstr ""
"**Configure.** "
"为批次命名，可选填写描述。保留文件中的模型，或为所有请求选择同一个模型；文件包含多个模型或你无权使用的模型时必须选择。对 "
"Chat，你还可以为所有请求设置 `temperature` 和 `max_tokens`。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:445
msgid ""
"**Check and confirm.** The gateway checks every line without running or "
"billing anything. Each problem names its line, `custom_id` and field, "
"never the content, and the list downloads as CSV or JSONL. A valid file "
"shows the first stored requests, the canonical model, the window (24 "
"hours unless the operator set none), billing and result retention."
msgstr ""
"**Check and confirm.** 网关检查每一行，但不运行、不计费。每个问题都指明其行号、`custom_id` "
"和字段，从不包含内容，问题列表可以下载为 CSV 或 "
"JSONL。文件有效时，页面会显示前几个保存的请求、规范模型、窗口（除非运维人员取消了窗口，否则为 24 小时）、计费方式和结果保留期。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:447
msgid ""
"The console is stricter than `/v1/batches`: a field the gateway would not"
" forward is an error instead of being dropped, for example "
"`max_completion_tokens` (rename it to `max_tokens`) or `user`, and so are"
" a byte-order mark, a key repeated within an object, and `NaN` or "
"`Infinity`. Stored requests name the canonical model and must fit the "
"upload size limit."
msgstr ""
"控制台比 `/v1/batches` 更严格：网关不会转发的字段会被视为错误而不是被丢弃，例如 "
"`max_completion_tokens`（请改名为 `max_tokens`）或 `user`；字节顺序标记、对象内重复的键以及 `NaN`"
" 或 `Infinity` 也是错误。保存的请求使用规范模型名，并且必须符合上传大小限制。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:449
msgid ""
"A console batch runs under your active API key; the page never creates "
"one, but links to **API Keys** before you submit. Signing out does not "
"stop a submitted batch, but revoking or regenerating the key fails its "
"unfinished requests. If the key or the resolved model changes between "
"check and submission, check again. Uploading and checking cost nothing; "
"submitting needs quota left."
msgstr ""
"控制台创建的批次在你当前的 API 密钥下运行；页面从不创建密钥，但会在你提交之前提供 **API Keys** "
"的链接。退出登录不会停止已提交的批次，但吊销或重新生成该密钥会使其未完成的请求失败。如果密钥或解析出的模型在检查和提交之间发生变化，请重新检查。上传和检查不产生费用；提交需要还有额度。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:451
msgid ""
"Each submission keeps its `Idempotency-Key` in your browser until its "
"outcome is known, so a timeout, a reload or a second tab finds the batch "
"instead of creating another. When an answer never arrived and more than a"
" day has passed, the page asks before submitting again, since that can "
"create and bill a second batch."
msgstr ""
"每次提交都会在浏览器中保存其 `Idempotency-"
"Key`，直到结果确定，因此超时、刷新页面或打开第二个标签页时，都会找到已创建的批次而不是再创建一个。如果一直没有收到响应且已超过一天，页面会在再次提交之前询问你，因为再次提交可能创建并计费第二个批次。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:453
msgid ""
"**Copy as new batch** reopens the create page with a batch's source file "
"and settings, for console batches and for API file batches of the Chat or"
" Embeddings target whose input file is still stored (otherwise you upload"
" the file again). Direct-request, Messages and Responses batches cannot "
"be copied yet. **Uploaded files** lists and deletes your uploads, which "
"are kept for `BATCH_FILE_RETENTION_DAYS`; deleting one does not affect "
"submitted batches. When your settings change what is stored, the batch "
"keeps its own copy of the requests, which counts toward your storage. A "
"finished Chat or Embeddings batch offers **Export unfinished requests**: "
"its failed, expired and cancelled requests as a new input file."
msgstr ""
"**Copy as new batch** 会用某个批次的源文件和设置重新打开创建页面，适用于控制台创建的批次，以及输入文件仍然保存着的 Chat"
" 或 Embeddings 目标的 API 文件批次（否则需要重新上传文件）。直接提交的批次、Messages 批次和 Responses "
"批次暂时无法复制。**Uploaded files** 列出并删除你上传的文件，这些文件保留 "
"`BATCH_FILE_RETENTION_DAYS` "
"天；删除文件不影响已提交的批次。当你的设置改变了保存的内容时，批次会保留自己的一份请求副本，计入你的存储用量。已结束的 Chat 或 "
"Embeddings 批次提供 **Export unfinished requests**：把其中失败、过期和取消的请求导出为新的输入文件。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:455
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "限制"

#: ../developer/batches.md:457
msgid ""
"Defaults; the operator may change any of them on the admin **Settings** "
"tab. Split a larger job into several batches."
msgstr "以下是默认值；运维人员可以在管理控制台的 **Settings** 标签页修改其中任何一项。更大的任务请拆分成多个批次。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Limit"
msgstr "限制项"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "设置项"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Size of a create request's body, and of an uploaded input file"
msgstr "创建请求体的大小，以及上传的输入文件的大小"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "32 MiB (`413` above it)"
msgstr "32 MiB（超过返回 `413`）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`BATCH_MAX_BODY_MB`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Requests per batch"
msgstr "每个批次的请求数"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "50,000"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`BATCH_MAX_REQUESTS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"Unfinished batches per user (`validating`, `in_progress`, `finalizing` or"
" `cancelling`)"
msgstr "每个用户未完成的批次数（`validating`、`in_progress`、`finalizing` 或 `cancelling`）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "10 (`429` above it)"
msgstr "10（超过返回 `429`）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`BATCH_MAX_ACTIVE_PER_USER`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Unfinished requests per user, across batches"
msgstr "每个用户在所有批次中未完成的请求数"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "100,000 (`429` above it)"
msgstr "100,000（超过返回 `429`）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`BATCH_MAX_QUEUED_REQUESTS_PER_USER`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "One line of an input file"
msgstr "输入文件的一行"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "4 MiB"
msgstr "4 MiB"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`BATCH_MAX_LINE_KB`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Input files a user may keep"
msgstr "每个用户可保留的输入文件"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "512 MiB"
msgstr "512 MiB"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`BATCH_FILES_MAX_TOTAL_MB_PER_USER`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"Uploads per user per hour, failed ones included (counted in each gateway "
"process)"
msgstr "每个用户每小时的上传次数，包括失败的上传（各网关进程分别计数）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "60"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`BATCH_FILE_UPLOADS_PER_HOUR`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Days an uploaded input file is kept"
msgstr "已上传输入文件的保留天数"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "30"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`BATCH_FILE_RETENTION_DAYS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Time a batch has to start its requests (`completion_window`)"
msgstr "批次启动其请求的时限（`completion_window`）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"24 hours, 1–168; file batches always 24 hours; `0` means no limit for "
"every batch"
msgstr "24 小时，可设 1–168；文件批次固定为 24 小时；`0` 表示所有批次都不限时"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`BATCH_COMPLETION_WINDOW_HOURS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Days a finished batch and its results are kept"
msgstr "已结束的批次及其结果的保留天数"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "7"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`BATCH_RETENTION_DAYS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Response one request may store"
msgstr "单个请求可保存的响应"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`BATCH_MAX_RESULT_KB`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"Responses one batch may store (counted in each gateway process; `0` means"
" no limit)"
msgstr "单个批次可保存的响应总量（各网关进程分别计数；`0` 表示不限）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "8 GiB"
msgstr "8 GiB"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`BATCH_MAX_RESULTS_MB_PER_BATCH`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:474
msgid "A batch keeps the window and retention it was created with."
msgstr "批次保留其创建时的窗口和保留期。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:476
msgid "Errors from the create call"
msgstr "创建调用的错误"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "When"
msgstr "何时出现"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`400`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"The body is not valid JSON or not a batch; a request is invalid, uses an "
"unknown or auto model, or repeats a `custom_id`; too many requests; a "
"Messages batch without a known, allowed `anthropic-version` header, or "
"another batch with one; an `anthropic_version` field in the body; an "
"`anthropic-beta` header; or the request carries `X-On-Behalf-Of`"
msgstr ""
"请求体不是有效的 JSON 或不是批次；某个请求无效、使用了未知模型或 auto 模型，或 `custom_id` "
"重复；请求过多；Messages 批次没有已知且允许的 `anthropic-version` 请求头，或其他批次带有该请求头；请求体中有 "
"`anthropic_version` 字段；带有 `anthropic-beta` 请求头；或请求带有 `X-On-Behalf-Of`"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`401`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"The API key is invalid or expired, or the account becomes unavailable "
"before the batch is stored"
msgstr "认证时 API key 无效或已过期，或在批次存储之前账户变得不可用"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`403`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"Your role may not create batches, or the credential is an inference grant"
" (`insufficient_scope`)"
msgstr "你的角色不允许创建批次，或所用凭据是推理授权（`insufficient_scope`）"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`404`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "Batch inference is not available on this gateway"
msgstr "此网关不提供批量推理"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`409`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "The `Idempotency-Key` was already used with a different request"
msgstr "该 `Idempotency-Key` 已用于另一个不同的请求"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`410`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "The `Idempotency-Key`'s batch has been deleted"
msgstr "该 `Idempotency-Key` 对应的批次已被删除"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`413`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "The body is larger than the size limit"
msgstr "请求体超过大小限制"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`429`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"You have the most unfinished batches allowed, the batch would take your "
"unfinished requests over their limit, your daily or monthly quota is used"
" up, or the key has spent its own budget"
msgstr "你的未完成批次已达上限、该批次会让你的未完成请求超过上限、你的每日或每月额度已用完，或这个 key 已用完它自己的预算"

#: ../developer/batches.md:489
msgid ""
"A file batch is counted against the limit on unfinished requests while "
"its file is read, after the create call has answered; over the limit, it "
"is `failed` with `queued_request_limit` in `errors`."
msgstr ""
"文件批次在创建调用返回之后、读取文件期间计入未完成请求的限额；超过限额时，批次为 `failed`，`errors` 中带有 "
"`queued_request_limit`。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:491
msgid "Compared with OpenAI's batch API"
msgstr "与 OpenAI Batch API 的比较"

#: ../developer/batches.md:493
msgid ""
"Batch requests cost the same as interactive ones. There is no batch "
"discount: the gateway runs each request itself instead of using a "
"provider's batch service."
msgstr "批量请求与交互式请求费用相同。没有批量折扣：网关自己运行每个请求，而不是使用 provider 的批处理服务。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:494
msgid ""
"The limits are the deployment's (see [Limits](#limits)) and lower than "
"the providers' own."
msgstr "各项限制由部署决定（参见[限制](#limits)），低于 provider 自身的限制。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:495
msgid ""
"The 24-hour window of a file batch is when the gateway stops starting "
"requests. Running requests finish, so a batch may end after `expires_at`."
" If the operator removed the window, a file batch still reports "
"`completion_window` `24h`, with a `null` `expires_at`."
msgstr ""
"文件批次的 24 小时窗口是网关停止启动新请求的时间。正在运行的请求会完成，因此批次可能在 `expires_at` "
"之后才结束。如果运维人员取消了窗口，文件批次仍报告 `completion_window` 为 `24h`，但 `expires_at` 为 "
"`null`。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:496
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Direct requests, `GET /v1/batches/{id}/results`, the JSONL export, `POST "
"/v1/batches/{id}/retry-failed`, `DELETE /v1/batches/{id}`, `Idempotency-"
"Key`, the Messages target and the cost fields are this gateway's own."
msgstr ""
"直接提交请求、`GET /v1/batches/{id}/results`、JSONL 导出、`POST /v1/batches/{id"
"}/retry-failed`、`DELETE /v1/batches/{id}`、`Idempotency-Key`、Messages "
"目标和费用字段是本网关自己的扩展。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:497
msgid "Only `purpose=batch` files exist, and they serve batches only."
msgstr "只存在 `purpose=batch` 的文件，且它们只用于批次。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:498
msgid "Messages batches belong to your account; there are no workspaces."
msgstr "Messages 批次属于你的账户；没有工作区的概念。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:500
msgid "Running batch inference"
msgstr "运行批量推理"

#: ../developer/batches.md:502
msgid ""
"These settings, and those in [Limits](#limits), are on the admin "
"console's **Settings** tab, under **Batch**. None needs a restart: a "
"change applies to the next request and to the worker's next round."
msgstr ""
"这些设置以及[限制](#limits)中的设置，都位于管理控制台 **Settings** 标签页的 **Batch** "
"下。它们都不需要重启：修改对下一个请求和 worker 的下一轮生效。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`BATCH_ENABLED`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "on"
msgstr "开"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"Serve batch inference. Off, every batch, file and webhook route answers "
"`404`, the console hides the Batches entry and no queued request starts; "
"stored batches are kept, and the console's capability check and the admin"
" controls keep working"
msgstr ""
"提供批量推理服务。关闭时，所有批次、文件和 webhook 路由返回 `404`，控制台隐藏 Batches "
"入口，排队的请求不再启动；已保存的批次会保留，控制台的能力检查和管理控制功能仍然可用"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`BATCH_MIN_ROLE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`internal`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"Lowest role that may create batches, upload files and set up a batch "
"webhook (`free`, `pro`, `internal`, `admin`). A queued request also waits"
" while its owner's role is below it"
msgstr ""
"允许创建批次、上传文件和设置批次 webhook "
"的最低角色（`free`、`pro`、`internal`、`admin`）。排队中的请求在其所有者的角色低于该门槛时也会等待"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`BATCH_MODEL_CONCURRENCY`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "64"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"Batch requests a model without its own cap runs at once, across the "
"deployment. `0` pauses batch work on those models"
msgstr "没有单独上限的模型在整个部署中同时运行的批量请求数。`0` 会暂停这些模型上的批处理"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`BATCH_YIELD_TO_INTERACTIVE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"Interactive requests in flight on a model take slots from its batch cap. "
"Off, batch work fills the cap whatever the interactive load, and the next"
" two settings have no effect"
msgstr "某个模型上正在处理的交互式请求会占用其批量上限中的名额。关闭时，无论交互式负载如何，批处理都会占满上限，接下来的两个设置项也不再起作用"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`BATCH_SHARED_INTERACTIVE_LOAD`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"Count every gateway process's interactive requests, not only the worker's"
" own. While the shared counts cannot be read, no new batch request starts"
msgstr "统计所有网关进程的交互式请求，而不只是 worker 所在进程的。无法读取共享计数时，不会启动新的批量请求"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`BATCH_INTERACTIVE_RESERVE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "0"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"Slots of every model's batch cap kept free for interactive requests, on "
"top of those in flight"
msgstr "在正在处理的交互式请求之外，每个模型的批量上限中再为交互式请求预留的名额"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`BATCH_ROLE_CONCURRENCY_FREE` / `_PRO` / `_INTERNAL` / `_ADMIN`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "8 / 16 / 64 / 64"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"Batch requests one user of that role may run at once, across models, "
"counted in each gateway process. Separate from interactive limits "
"(`user_concurrency_<role>` and per-user overrides don't apply to "
"batches); `0` removes the cap"
msgstr ""
"该角色的单个用户在所有模型上可同时运行的批量请求数，由各网关进程分别计数。与交互式限制相互独立（`user_concurrency_<role>`"
" 和单用户覆盖值不适用于批处理）；`0` 取消该上限"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`BATCH_QUEUED_ALERT_HOURS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "6"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"Hours a model may wait for capacity before one alert says so; it resolves"
" when the model next serves a batch request. `0` never alerts"
msgstr "模型等待容量多少小时后发出一条告警；模型再次处理批量请求时告警解除。`0` 表示从不告警"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`BATCH_ANTHROPIC_VERSIONS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`2023-06-01,2026-10-21`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"`anthropic-version` values a new Messages batch may name. Stored batches "
"keep running under their own"
msgstr "新的 Messages 批次可以使用的 `anthropic-version` 值。已保存的批次继续在各自的版本下运行"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "`BATCH_WEBHOOK_ALLOW_PRIVATE_TARGETS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid "off"
msgstr "关"

#: ../developer/batches.md:23
msgid ""
"Let webhooks reach private, loopback and link-local addresses (never "
"cloud metadata). For isolated test deployments only"
msgstr "允许 webhook 访问私有、回环和链路本地地址（云元数据地址始终禁止）。仅用于隔离的测试部署"

#: ../developer/batches.md:517
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A model's own cap is set under **Batch Concurrency** on the same tab: "
"empty takes `BATCH_MODEL_CONCURRENCY` and `0` pauses that model's batch "
"work. The section shows each model's running and queued batch requests, "
"and a change reaches every process within about ten seconds. Behind it "
"are `GET /admin/batch/models` and `PATCH /admin/batch/models/{model_id}` "
"with `{\"max_concurrency\": <n or null>}`. The cap counts every process's"
" requests against one limit."
msgstr ""
"单个模型自己的上限在同一标签页的 **Batch Concurrency** 下设置：留空则采用 "
"`BATCH_MODEL_CONCURRENCY`，`0` "
"暂停该模型的批处理。该部分显示每个模型正在运行和排队的批量请求数，修改会在约十秒内传到所有进程。其背后是 `GET "
"/admin/batch/models` 和 `PATCH /admin/batch/models/{model_id}`，请求体为 "
"`{\"max_concurrency\": <n or null>}`。该上限把所有进程的请求合并计入同一个限额。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:519
msgid ""
"Every gateway process runs a worker, and one batch's requests may run in "
"several of them. A stopping process hands its unfinished requests back; a"
" crashed one's are taken over when their lease runs out, a few minutes "
"later."
msgstr ""
"每个网关进程都运行一个 worker，同一批次的请求可能分布在多个 worker "
"上运行。正在停止的进程会交回其未完成的请求；崩溃进程的请求在其租约到期后（几分钟内）由其他进程接管。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:521
msgid ""
"Batches live in the operational database: `batch_jobs`, `batch_items`, "
"`batch_attempts` (one row per attempt, with its charge), "
"`batch_idempotency`, `batch_files`, `batch_file_chunks`, "
"`batch_webhooks`, `batch_webhook_events`, `batch_model_limits`, "
"`batch_user_state`, `batch_interactive_load` and `batch_read_leases`. "
"Each request a batch runs is an `api_logs` row with `batch_job_id` set. "
"Permanently deleting a user deletes their batches, files, idempotency "
"records and webhook."
msgstr ""
"批次保存在运行数据存储中：`batch_jobs`、`batch_items`、`batch_attempts`（每次尝试一行，含其费用）、`batch_idempotency`、`batch_files`、`batch_file_chunks`、`batch_webhooks`、`batch_webhook_events`、`batch_model_limits`、`batch_user_state`、`batch_interactive_load`"
" 和 `batch_read_leases`。批次运行的每个请求都是 `api_logs` 中设置了 `batch_job_id` "
"的一行。永久删除用户时，会一并删除其批次、文件、幂等记录和 webhook。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:523
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The admin console's **Batches** tab lists every user's batches with per-"
"user totals (`GET /admin/batch/summary`) and lets an administrator cancel"
" one. Known cost leaves out attempts with unknown cost, and shows how "
"many there are. **Prompts** opens a batch's stored requests and answers "
"(`GET /admin/batch/jobs/{batch_id}/requests`) only where the request log "
"keeps prompts (`db_store_full_content`), and answers `403` elsewhere; "
"each page read is audited as `batch.requests.read` against the owner, and"
" a page whose read cannot be audited is not returned. The tab's "
"**Requests** page lists the attempts the worker ran. **Recent Requests** "
"leaves batch requests out, so a large batch does not bury direct traffic;"
" the request-log endpoints take `source=batch` or `source=interactive`, "
"and `batch_id` for one batch. Rows logged while a model was queued for "
"capacity (`error` starting `UpstreamModelQueued:`) are left out of every "
"request count."
msgstr ""
"管理控制台的 **Batches** 标签页列出所有用户的批次及按用户的合计（`GET "
"/admin/batch/summary`），管理员可以取消其中任何批次。已知费用不包含费用未知的尝试，并显示这类尝试的数量。**Prompts**"
" 打开批次保存的请求和回答（`GET "
"/admin/batch/jobs/{batch_id}/requests`），仅在请求日志保存提示词（`db_store_full_content`）时可用，否则返回"
" `403`；每读取一页都会以 `batch.requests.read` 针对所有者记入审计日志，无法记录审计的页面不会返回。该标签页的 "
"**Requests** 页面列出 worker 运行过的尝试。**Recent Requests** "
"不包含批量请求，以免大批次淹没直接流量；请求日志端点接受 `source=batch` 或 "
"`source=interactive`，以及用于指定单个批次的 `batch_id`。模型排队等待容量期间记录的行（`error` 以 "
"`UpstreamModelQueued:` 开头）不计入任何请求统计。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:525
msgid "Which routes batch work may use"
msgstr "批处理可以使用哪些路由"

#: ../developer/batches.md:527
msgid ""
"A batch is work nobody waits on, so by default it runs only on servers "
"the gateway runs itself and never spends a cloud provider's quota or "
"money. A route is local when its `deployment_type` is `self_hosted`, or, "
"for `auto` (the default), when its host is `localhost`, `127.0.0.1`, "
"`0.0.0.0` or `host.docker.internal`."
msgstr ""
"批次是没人在等的工作，因此默认只在网关自己运行的服务器上执行，从不消耗云 provider 的额度或费用。当路由的 "
"`deployment_type` 为 `self_hosted`，或者为 `auto`（默认）且其主机是 "
"`localhost`、`127.0.0.1`、`0.0.0.0` 或 `host.docker.internal` 时，该路由是本地路由。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:529
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"An administrator can allow or forbid batch work on any route with `PATCH "
"/admin/routing/provider-route-batch/{model_id}/{route_id}` and "
"`{\"batch_allowed\": true}` or `false`, or `null` to follow locality "
"again. The choice is kept in `provider_route_batch_policies` by canonical"
" model id and route id; `GET /admin/routing/provider-routes` reports each"
" route's `batch_allowed`, `batch_allowed_default` and "
"`batch_allowed_choice`."
msgstr ""
"管理员可以用 `PATCH /admin/routing/provider-route-batch/{model_id}/{route_id}` "
"加 `{\"batch_allowed\": true}` 或 `false` 允许或禁止任何路由承担批处理，或用 `null` "
"让它重新按本地性决定。该选择按规范模型 id 和路由 id 保存在 `provider_route_batch_policies` 中；`GET "
"/admin/routing/provider-routes` 报告每个路由的 "
"`batch_allowed`、`batch_allowed_default` 和 `batch_allowed_choice`。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:531
msgid ""
"Batch requests stay on their model's batch-allowed routes through "
"selection, retries, fallback, offload and hedging, and neither follow nor"
" move the owner's routing affinity. A batch-allowed route that is "
"disabled, has an open circuit or has weight 0 makes items wait. Embedding"
" backends follow their locality, with no per-route choice. A batch for a "
"model with no batch-allowed route is refused (`batch_route_unavailable`, "
"`400`), and a queued item fails the same way when its turn comes, for "
"example after an upgrade for a model with only cloud routes: allow one of"
" its routes if its queued batches should finish."
msgstr ""
"批量请求在选路、重试、回退、分流和对冲过程中始终留在其模型允许批处理的路由上，既不遵循也不改变所有者的路由亲和性。被禁用、熔断器打开或权重为 0 "
"的允许批处理路由会让请求等待。Embedding "
"后端按其本地性决定，没有逐路由的选择。如果模型没有任何允许批处理的路由，其批次会被拒绝（`batch_route_unavailable`，`400`），已排队的请求轮到时也会以同样的错误失败，例如升级后某个模型只有云端路由时：如果希望其排队的批次完成，请允许它的某个路由承担批处理。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:533
msgid "Two cases to check:"
msgstr "需要检查的两种情况："

#: ../developer/batches.md:535
msgid ""
"A self-hosted engine on a LAN or cluster address counts as cloud unless "
"its route says `deployment_type: self_hosted`."
msgstr "位于局域网或集群地址上的自托管引擎会被视为云端，除非其路由声明了 `deployment_type: self_hosted`。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:536
msgid ""
"A proxy on the gateway host that forwards to a cloud API counts as local "
"unless its route says `deployment_type: provider_api`, or batch work is "
"forbidden on it."
msgstr "网关主机上转发到云端 API 的代理算作本地，除非其路由写明 `deployment_type: provider_api`，或者禁止它执行批处理。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:538
msgid "Upgrading a deployment"
msgstr "升级部署"

#: ../developer/batches.md:540
msgid ""
"A worker runs only the batch kinds it knows: claims, expiry, finalizing, "
"validation, sealing and cleanup filter on a batch's surface, target and "
"schema version in the database query. That filter exists from #1660 on, "
"so a rolling upgrade is supported from a release that includes #1660. "
"While both versions run:"
msgstr ""
"worker 只运行它认识的批次类型：认领、过期、收尾、校验、封存和清理都会在数据库查询中按批次的接口、目标和 schema 版本过滤。这个过滤从"
" #1660 开始存在，因此从包含 #1660 的版本起支持滚动升级。两个版本同时运行期间："

#: ../developer/batches.md:542
msgid ""
"an old process refuses a Messages-target create with `400`; retry it, or "
"wait until every process runs the new version;"
msgstr "旧进程会以 `400` 拒绝 Messages 目标的创建请求；请重试，或等到所有进程都运行新版本；"

#: ../developer/batches.md:543
msgid ""
"an old process ignores an `anthropic-version` header or "
"`anthropic_version` field on a non-Messages batch, which the new version "
"refuses;"
msgstr ""
"旧进程会忽略非 Messages 批次上的 `anthropic-version` 请求头或 `anthropic_version` "
"字段，而新版本会拒绝它们；"

#: ../developer/batches.md:544
msgid ""
"an old process still serves `/v1/messages/batches`, where the new version"
" answers `410`; the new version drains the batches created there."
msgstr "旧进程仍提供 `/v1/messages/batches`，而新版本对其返回 `410`；在那里创建的批次由新版本排空。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:546
msgid ""
"A release with a batch worker but without #1660 would run any batch it "
"finds, Messages batches included, as chat completions, and nothing the "
"new version does can stop or detect it. Upgrade from such a release, or "
"from an unknown one, with every old process stopped:"
msgstr ""
"有批量 worker 但不含 #1660 的版本会把找到的任何批次（包括 Messages 批次）当作 Chat Completions "
"运行，新版本既无法阻止也无法察觉。从这样的版本或未知版本升级时，必须先停掉所有旧进程："

#: ../developer/batches.md:548
msgid ""
"On the old version, turn `BATCH_ENABLED` off (Settings tab, or `python -m"
" serving.config.manage set BATCH_ENABLED false`). Within about ten "
"seconds every old worker stops claiming and logs that its batch worker is"
" disabled; running requests finish or are handed back."
msgstr ""
"在旧版本上关闭 `BATCH_ENABLED`（Settings 标签页，或 `python -m serving.config.manage "
"set BATCH_ENABLED false`）。约十秒内，每个旧 worker 都会停止认领，并在日志中记录其批量 worker "
"已禁用；正在运行的请求会完成或被交回。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:549
msgid ""
"Stop every old gateway process, replica and worker, and turn off whatever"
" would restart one (restart policies, autoscaling, health-check "
"replacement, deploy jobs)."
msgstr "停止所有旧的网关进程、副本和 worker，并关闭任何会重新启动它们的机制（重启策略、自动扩缩容、健康检查替换、部署任务）。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:550
msgid ""
"Confirm none is left using your orchestrator's identity of each process "
"(image, revision, release or deployment id). Neither a database client "
"address nor the health endpoint shows the version."
msgstr "用编排系统对每个进程的标识（镜像、修订、发布或部署 id）确认已没有残留。数据库客户端地址和健康检查端点都无法显示版本。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:551
msgid ""
"Wait until no session of the gateway's database user is left (the query "
"in step 5 of [Rolling back](#rolling-back))."
msgstr "等待网关数据库用户的会话全部结束（使用[回滚](#rolling-back)第 5 步中的查询）。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:552
msgid "Start the new version. It keeps `BATCH_ENABLED` off."
msgstr "启动新版本。它会保持 `BATCH_ENABLED` 关闭。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:553
msgid ""
"Once only the new version runs, confirmed as in step 3, turn "
"`BATCH_ENABLED` on."
msgstr "按第 3 步确认只有新版本在运行后，开启 `BATCH_ENABLED`。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:555
msgid "Coming from a version without `BATCH_ROLE_CONCURRENCY_<ROLE>`:"
msgstr "从没有 `BATCH_ROLE_CONCURRENCY_<ROLE>` 的版本升级时："

#: ../developer/batches.md:557
msgid ""
"`BATCH_MODEL_CONCURRENCY` now defaults to 64, but a stored value still "
"applies: a deployment that saved the old default of 4 keeps 4."
msgstr "`BATCH_MODEL_CONCURRENCY` 现在默认为 64，但已保存的值仍然有效：保存过旧默认值 4 的部署仍为 4。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:558
msgid ""
"`BATCH_USER_MAX_CONCURRENCY` is gone and ignored; "
"`BATCH_ROLE_CONCURRENCY_<ROLE>` is the per-user batch limit."
msgstr ""
"`BATCH_USER_MAX_CONCURRENCY` 已移除并会被忽略；`BATCH_ROLE_CONCURRENCY_<ROLE>` "
"是单用户的批量限制。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:559
msgid ""
"`user_concurrency_<role>` and per-user concurrency overrides no longer "
"limit batch requests."
msgstr "`user_concurrency_<role>` 和单用户并发覆盖值不再限制批量请求。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:561
msgid ""
"`BATCH_EXPANSION_ENABLED` controls nothing. A leftover value is not shown"
" on the Settings tab, cannot be set there and is warned about once at "
"startup; the gateway keeps it so that a rollback to a release that still "
"uses it (#1660 up to, but not including, #1673) reads it again. Once no "
"such release will run, delete it (`DELETE "
"/admin/config/BATCH_EXPANSION_ENABLED`, or `python -m "
"serving.config.manage reset BATCH_EXPANSION_ENABLED`) and unset the "
"variable."
msgstr ""
"`BATCH_EXPANSION_ENABLED` 不再控制任何东西。残留的值不会显示在 Settings "
"标签页上，也无法在那里设置，启动时会给出一次警告；网关保留它，以便回滚到仍使用它的版本（从 #1660 到 #1673 "
"之前）时能再次读取。确定不会再运行这样的版本后，请删除它（`DELETE "
"/admin/config/BATCH_EXPANSION_ENABLED` 或 `python -m serving.config.manage"
" reset BATCH_EXPANSION_ENABLED`），并取消设置该环境变量。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:563
msgid "Rolling back"
msgstr "回滚"

#: ../developer/batches.md:565
msgid ""
"Before starting an older version, drain with this version the batches the"
" older one cannot run, and start the older one only once no process of "
"this version is left. Which batches those are, and the query that lists "
"them (the drain query), depends on the target version:"
msgstr "启动旧版本之前，先用当前版本排空旧版本无法运行的批次，并且只在当前版本的进程全部消失后才启动旧版本。这些批次是哪些，以及列出它们的查询（排空查询），取决于目标版本："

#: ../developer/batches.md:567
msgid ""
"To #1660 or later: Messages batches created through `/v1/batches`. That "
"version neither runs nor expires them, though it can cancel and delete "
"them."
msgstr ""
"回滚到 #1660 或之后的版本：通过 `/v1/batches` 创建的 Messages "
"批次。该版本既不运行也不让它们过期，但可以取消和删除它们。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:574
msgid ""
"To a version before #1660: every batch that is not an inline chat batch, "
"which it would run as chat completions."
msgstr "回滚到 #1660 之前的版本：所有不是内联 Chat 批次的批次，该版本会把它们当作 Chat Completions 运行。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:583
msgid ""
"An empty result is not enough while this version still runs, because a "
"create admitted a moment earlier can still store a batch. Follow every "
"step:"
msgstr "当前版本仍在运行时，查询结果为空还不够，因为片刻之前被接受的创建请求仍可能保存一个批次。请逐步执行："

#: ../developer/batches.md:585
msgid ""
"Set `BATCH_MIN_ROLE` to `admin` so no one else can create batches, and "
"create none yourself. Other users' queued requests stop starting too, so "
"cancel their batches rather than wait. To let them finish instead, skip "
"this step; step 6 still catches a batch created meanwhile."
msgstr ""
"把 `BATCH_MIN_ROLE` 设为 "
"`admin`，让其他人无法创建批次，你自己也不要创建。其他用户排队的请求也会停止启动，所以要取消他们的批次，而不是等待。如果想让它们运行完，可以跳过这一步；第"
" 6 步仍会发现期间新建的批次。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:586
msgid ""
"Cancel or let finish every batch the drain query lists (the admin "
"**Batches** tab can cancel anyone's), and wait until it returns no rows; "
"a cancelled file batch needs a moment to seal."
msgstr ""
"取消或等待完成排空查询列出的每个批次（管理控制台的 **Batches** "
"标签页可以取消任何人的批次），直到查询不再返回任何行；被取消的文件批次需要片刻才能封存。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:587
msgid ""
"Turn `BATCH_ENABLED` off. New batch requests now get `404`, but one "
"already past its checks may still be reaching the database."
msgstr "关闭 `BATCH_ENABLED`。新的批量请求现在会得到 `404`，但已经通过检查的请求可能仍在写入数据库的途中。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:588
msgid ""
"Stop every process of this version, every replica and worker, and keep "
"them stopped (restart policies, autoscaling, health-check replacement, "
"deploy jobs) until the final check. Don't start the older version yet."
msgstr "停止当前版本的所有进程、副本和 worker，并在最后检查完成之前保持停止（重启策略、自动扩缩容、健康检查替换、部署任务）。此时还不要启动旧版本。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:589
msgid ""
"Confirm that no session of the gateway's database user is left, so every "
"transaction has committed or rolled back. Run this as another user, or in"
" your own session, which it leaves out; it must return no rows:"
msgstr "确认网关数据库用户的会话已全部结束，即所有事务都已提交或回滚。请以另一个用户运行以下查询，或在你自己的会话中运行（查询会排除该会话）；它必须不返回任何行："

#: ../developer/batches.md:599
msgid ""
"A session can outlive its process while the server finishes a query or "
"commit, or before it notices the connection is gone. Wait for it to end. "
"If one stays and its host certainly runs no gateway, "
"`pg_terminate_backend(pid)` ends it and rolls back its transaction."
msgstr ""
"会话可能比其进程活得更久：服务器可能还在完成某个查询或提交，或者尚未察觉连接已断开。请等待它结束。如果某个会话一直存在，而且你确定它的主机已经不运行网关，`pg_terminate_backend(pid)`"
" 会结束它并回滚其事务。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:600
msgid ""
"Run the drain query again. Only if it returns no rows, start the older "
"version. It keeps `BATCH_ENABLED` off; turn it on and restore "
"`BATCH_MIN_ROLE` once only the older version runs."
msgstr ""
"再次运行排空查询。只有在它不返回任何行时，才启动旧版本。旧版本会保持 `BATCH_ENABLED` 关闭；确认只有旧版本在运行后，再开启它并恢复"
" `BATCH_MIN_ROLE`。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:602
msgid ""
"The last check waits for a quiet database because each create is one "
"transaction and only gateway processes write batches: once no gateway "
"session is left and none can start, every create has committed or rolled "
"back. If step 6 returns rows, do not start the older version (one before "
"#1660 would run them as chat completions; a later one would leave them "
"unrun). Start this version again, alone, turn `BATCH_ENABLED` on so its "
"worker can run or seal those batches, cancel them or let them finish, and"
" repeat steps 3 to 6."
msgstr ""
"最后一项检查之所以要等数据库静止，是因为每个创建请求都是一个事务，而且只有网关进程会写入批次：一旦没有网关会话残留、也不会再有新会话，所有创建请求都已提交或回滚。如果第"
" 6 步返回了行，不要启动旧版本（#1660 之前的版本会把它们当作 Chat Completions "
"运行；之后的版本则会让它们永远得不到运行）。请重新启动当前版本，且只启动它，开启 `BATCH_ENABLED`，让其 worker "
"运行或封存这些批次，取消它们或等待完成，然后重复第 3 到 6 步。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:604
msgid "Once the older version runs:"
msgstr "旧版本运行后："

#: ../developer/batches.md:606
msgid ""
"A release from #1660 up to, but not including, #1673 reads "
"`BATCH_EXPANSION_ENABLED` again, off by default, so it refuses its newer "
"batch kinds until the setting is on; accepted batches keep running."
msgstr ""
"从 #1660 到 #1673 之前的版本会重新读取 "
"`BATCH_EXPANSION_ENABLED`，其默认关闭，因此在开启该设置之前会拒绝创建较新的批次类型；已接受的批次继续运行。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:607
msgid ""
"Any release from #1660 serves `/v1/messages/batches` again, showing only "
"the batches stored through it."
msgstr "从 #1660 起的任何版本都会重新提供 `/v1/messages/batches`，并且只显示通过它保存的批次。"

#: ../developer/batches.md:608
msgid ""
"A rollback rewrites no rows. A version before #1660 lists and purges "
"batches of the newer kinds as if they were inline chat batches, and "
"leaves uploaded files and webhooks unread until the next upgrade."
msgstr ""
"回滚不会改写任何行。#1660 之前的版本会把较新类型的批次当作内联 Chat 批次来列出和清理，并且在下次升级之前不会读取已上传的文件和 "
"webhook。"

